      "uid": "zhcn:76fe87b9c74fe7639ca16cf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想与伏特加。\n看着她们在激战后互相称赞对方英姿的模样，\n会场内的气氛变得比之前更加热烈沸腾了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e885c724f46a5a1ed6837e078b045dd823a55f72184a1278a065a632a2653c6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136314.json",
